  "description": "The agent read the figures of speech and ADJUSTED its meaning-vector machinery to suit. detect_figure draws figure_of itself; classify_figure is one discriminator covering TEN figures, each by the agent-designed test: SIMILE (like/as comparator part), OXYMORON (two conjoined parts carry an opposes edge - INTERNAL pair-layer), IRONY (literal reading opposes the CONTEXT - EXTERNAL pair-layer, guarded: no context no irony), HYPERBOLE (magnitude far above plausible - scalar up), UNDERSTATEMENT (magnitude far below the real situation - scalar down), IDIOM (non-compositional + stored whole), METONYMY (same-domain association), PERSONIFICATION (inanimate subject + human predicate - type mismatch), METAPHOR (cross-domain resemblance). detect_allegory = structure-mapping over a narrative. Oxymoron/irony share one tension primitive (internal vs external); hyperbole/understatement share one scalar test (up vs down). Graph-native; structural tests checked first.",
